2580	# thread), ProviderConfig { engine; launcher }. Error: an unknown engine or a missing model.
2581	# (wave 29) An engine that takes a roster `auth` (claude: AuthModes subscription | api-key; '' = the
2582	# first): Auth is kept on the identity, and (D7 / F03-7) the endpoint - the fingerprint the health
2583	# records are keyed by - is the engine + the auth mode + the model family
2584	# ('cc-engine-v1|claude|subscription|opus'): an Opus limit never marks Sonnet or the API key out.
2585	# (wave 29b, E5) auth endpoint (the roster entry's $Endpoint): the ROUTE identity -
2586	# 'cc-engine-v1|claude|endpoint|<canonical base_url>|<env_key name>' (lineage, parenting, the
2587	# health of auth, transport and capability failures); provider_config {engine, launcher,
2588	# credential_mechanism endpoint, base_url, env_key, plan}; Display names the base URL. The plan
2589	# (quota) is not part of it (Get-PlanQuotaVerdict). An endpoint auth without an endpoint is an error.
